<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Page Not Found — Trip Control</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#12162A; --panel:#1B2140; --cream:#EFE9D8; --muted:#8D93B8;
  --saffron:#E8963C; --teal:#33ABA0; --line:rgba(246,241,228,0.12); --line-strong:rgba(246,241,228,0.22);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
  margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 1200px 600px at 15% -10%, rgba(232,150,60,0.10), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 700px at 100% 10%, rgba(51,171,160,0.10), transparent 55%),
    var(--ink);
  color:var(--cream);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
.main{text-align:center;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
.code{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:120px;line-height:1;margin:0 0 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--saffron),var(--teal));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
h1{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;}
p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 28px;}
a.btn{display:inline-block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--saffron);color:#1B1204;}
a.btn:hover{box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(232,150,60,0.28);}
.mono{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:32px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="main">
  <div class="code">404</div>
  <h1>Page Not Found</h1>
  <p>Sorry, the page you're looking for doesn't exist — maybe it was moved off the map.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/">Go Home</a>
  <div class="mono">Trip Control</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>